WEBVTT

00:00:02.649 --> 00:00:03.609
What is it now?

00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:05.319
You can't even get up?

00:00:05.402 --> 00:00:10.365
FIST OF FLOWING WATER CRUSHING ROCK

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.494
When I made you my disciple,

00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:16.580
didn't I say to train like
your life depended on it?

00:00:16.872 --> 00:00:19.166
I cannot see you ever
improving your skills.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:22.085
You haven't one iota of talent
for the martial arts!

00:00:22.419 --> 00:00:24.588
From this moment, you are
expelled from the dojo.

00:00:26.006 --> 00:00:27.591
Never come here again!

00:00:42.606 --> 00:00:44.691
Through the once tranquil town

00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:47.027
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:50.948
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:53.951
Who ts going to take the lead

00:00:54.034 --> 00:00:56.411
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:00:56.578 --> 00:01:01.333
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:03.377
We know, We are...

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.129
HEROES!

00:01:06.213 --> 00:01:07.840
Why were you

00:01:07.965 --> 00:01:10.133
born of evil?

00:01:10.259 --> 00:01:12.219
If you wish to know

00:01:12.344 --> 00:01:14.638
I shall tell!

00:01:14.721 --> 00:01:20.602
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:24.106
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:01:25.399 --> 00:01:29.987
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:01:30.112 --> 00:01:34.658
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:01:34.783 --> 00:01:39.329
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:01:39.454 --> 00:01:45.460
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:01:45.544 --> 00:01:49.006
He must fight!

00:02:00.517 --> 00:02:02.102
Bang is acting strangely?

00:02:02.144 --> 00:02:07.065
THE HUNT BEGINS

00:02:07.107 --> 00:02:09.693
But Master Bang has always
been so kind-hearted...

00:02:10.193 --> 00:02:11.486
Something's going on.

00:02:12.696 --> 00:02:15.365
I thought you guys
might know what it is!

00:02:15.657 --> 00:02:16.658
I do not.

00:02:17.075 --> 00:02:19.620
Bang, as in the Class S hero
Silverfang?

00:02:21.246 --> 00:02:23.874
If you're done talking,
let's play some more.

00:02:25.751 --> 00:02:27.210
There's more of them now...

00:02:27.961 --> 00:02:30.047
I can make an educated guess.

00:02:30.505 --> 00:02:32.341
It probably has to do with Garou.

00:02:32.758 --> 00:02:33.717
Garou?!

00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:37.179
The guy Master chased out
of our dojo? Why him?

00:02:37.554 --> 00:02:40.307
I see. So you haven't heard?

00:02:40.641 --> 00:02:42.976
Bang's former disciple Garou

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:46.396
has been added to the Association's
wanted list as a violent monster.

00:02:46.772 --> 00:02:48.899
Bang volunteered to take him down.

00:02:49.066 --> 00:02:51.193
A monster?! Garou?!

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:53.946
Apparently, there was an incident
at Association HQ.

00:02:54.446 --> 00:02:56.323
The Association has been
keeping it under wraps,

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:00.160
but if a violent battle ensues,
it could spin out of control.

00:03:00.786 --> 00:03:03.372
Perhaps that is why Bang
pushed you away?

00:03:04.581 --> 00:03:05.999
I had no idea.

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:07.417
So Master Bang...

00:03:08.418 --> 00:03:10.170
...considers me a burden?

00:03:11.171 --> 00:03:14.257
Master, what are your thoughts
about Bang's behavior?

00:03:14.675 --> 00:03:18.595
I don't really know
the old dude so well...

00:03:19.471 --> 00:03:21.181
"Silverfang..."

00:03:21.723 --> 00:03:23.517
Now that's a cool hero name.

00:03:24.226 --> 00:03:26.436
Especially compared to "Caped Baldy."

00:03:28.772 --> 00:03:30.565
There /s one thing
that bothers me.

00:03:31.942 --> 00:03:32.776
Who are you?

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:36.279
Master, this pissant is Charanko,
Bang's current top disciple.

00:03:36.446 --> 00:03:37.406
You met him before.

00:03:37.698 --> 00:03:39.658
Huh? I did?

00:03:43.453 --> 00:03:45.831
I can't allow myself
to be a burden...

00:03:46.039 --> 00:03:49.251
For my master's sake,
I need to stop Garou.

00:03:51.003 --> 00:03:53.588
But it's not like I can just
go find him.

00:03:55.757 --> 00:03:58.093
And even if I did track him down,
I'd only—

00:03:58.176 --> 00:03:59.136
Hey, you.

00:04:03.223 --> 00:04:04.057
You're a hero, yeah?

00:04:04.391 --> 00:04:06.643
I am indeed.
I'm called Mumen Rider.

00:04:07.519 --> 00:04:07.936
Time to hunt.

00:04:08.353 --> 00:04:10.355
"Hunt"? What do you mean?

00:04:10.814 --> 00:04:12.691
You don't seem like
one of my fans.

00:04:12.983 --> 00:04:15.610
To complete my evolution
into a monster...

00:04:16.486 --> 00:04:17.696
...you're the exact prey I need.

00:04:17.821 --> 00:04:19.489
Found you!

00:04:20.365 --> 00:04:21.950
You sure that's the one?

00:04:22.159 --> 00:04:23.326
I'm sure.

00:04:23.618 --> 00:04:25.829
Now, time for a little payb—

00:04:27.497 --> 00:04:31.126
You came for vengeance,
Tank-top Vegetarian?

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:34.671
Your life was hung by a thread.
Now you're here to throw it away?

00:04:35.172 --> 00:04:36.631
Your stupidity is almost cute.

00:04:37.466 --> 00:04:39.926
Your muscle-head friends
won't be leaving alive either.

00:04:40.385 --> 00:04:41.344
Die!

00:04:48.018 --> 00:04:48.351
What the—?!

00:04:49.436 --> 00:04:51.313
CLASS S, RANK 16
TANK-TOP MASTER

00:04:51.521 --> 00:04:55.025
A Class S$?! Ohh yeah!
Looks like I hooked a big one.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.485
This is perfect!

00:04:56.902 --> 00:04:57.778
I'm fired up!

00:05:10.415 --> 00:05:13.752
Tank-top Tackle!

00:05:14.127 --> 00:05:16.671
There it is!
Master's Tank-top Tackle!

00:05:16.755 --> 00:05:19.674
He's used that move to take out
tons of monsters!

00:05:20.342 --> 00:05:21.384
Get him, Master!

00:05:21.593 --> 00:05:23.011
That bastard can't stand up to—

00:05:27.265 --> 00:05:28.058
Big Bro!

00:05:28.141 --> 00:05:29.226
He didn't go down!

00:05:29.559 --> 00:05:31.645
Get ready to run, Lil' Bro!

00:05:33.355 --> 00:05:35.649
/s this guy...

00:05:37.526 --> 00:05:39.111
... feally human?

00:05:42.197 --> 00:05:44.449
Have you put all your affairs
in order?

00:05:44.908 --> 00:05:47.786
I'm an old man, alone in the world.

00:05:48.161 --> 00:05:49.578
Just like you.

00:05:49.579 --> 00:05:54.876
BOMB, MASTER OF
THE FIST OF WHIRLING WIND

00:05:55.418 --> 00:05:56.962
You cut ties to everything you have

00:05:57.087 --> 00:05:59.089
to come to your dear
younger brother's aid.

00:05:59.756 --> 00:06:01.550
Who could ask for more, brother?

00:06:02.843 --> 00:06:04.928
If we don't stop that Garou fellow,

00:06:05.178 --> 00:06:07.556
he'll no doubt come after
my dojo too one day.

00:06:08.431 --> 00:06:09.641
Of course I came!

00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:11.935
We must be careful, brother.

00:06:12.519 --> 00:06:16.064
No telling how strong
the wretch has become by now.

00:06:16.314 --> 00:06:19.192
He certainly concerned you
enough to call me.

00:06:19.776 --> 00:06:22.737
Yeah, another Tank-top Punch!

00:06:23.113 --> 00:06:25.448
When he survived Master's tackle,

00:06:25.532 --> 00:06:26.658
I was scared for a second!

00:06:26.908 --> 00:06:28.743
Looks like this
won't take too long.

00:06:29.244 --> 00:06:30.745
He's human.

00:06:31.246 --> 00:06:32.789
That's for certain.

00:06:33.832 --> 00:06:35.876
But then... Why?

00:06:36.543 --> 00:06:39.254
Why this premonition
that I should kill him right here?

00:06:42.424 --> 00:06:45.051
Unfortunately, you die now!

00:06:45.135 --> 00:06:47.470
Hold it right there!

00:06:50.765 --> 00:06:51.725
Mumen Rider?!

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:53.768
Have you no shame?!

00:06:53.977 --> 00:06:58.148
A Class S hero,
about to kill a human?!

00:06:58.982 --> 00:07:00.317
You already won the fight!

00:07:00.483 --> 00:07:02.819
The bastard attacked a hero!
It's his own fault!

00:07:02.903 --> 00:07:03.862
Stay out of it!

00:07:03.987 --> 00:07:05.739
We'll teach him to mess with us!

00:07:06.031 --> 00:07:07.032
That's enough.

00:07:07.741 --> 00:07:09.409
What he says is right.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.245
I didn't earn the right
to wear this tank-top

00:07:12.329 --> 00:07:14.497
so I could battle humans.

00:07:14.873 --> 00:07:15.832
Listen up, you...

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:20.045
Let this be a lesson
never to harm others again.

00:07:22.088 --> 00:07:23.048
Yeah, all right.

00:07:23.882 --> 00:07:24.841
I'm leaving.

00:07:25.342 --> 00:07:26.885
Sorry for the trouble.

00:07:28.803 --> 00:07:29.846
Fuck that!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:32.682
I'm still gonna slaughter
every last one of you.

00:07:32.807 --> 00:07:35.185
Yeah, thought so.

00:07:35.685 --> 00:07:37.187
You die right here, right now!

00:07:39.731 --> 00:07:42.192
Dam, it shipped out.

00:07:42.651 --> 00:07:45.527
I've been avoiding this style
since it reminds me of the old geezer.

00:07:45.528 --> 00:07:46.947
FIST OF FLOWING WATER
CRUSHING ROCK

00:07:55.538 --> 00:07:56.039
He...

00:07:57.374 --> 00:07:59.000
... Hid his true strength?

00:07:59.668 --> 00:08:00.669
Imagine that!

00:08:01.419 --> 00:08:04.047
A Class S hero on his knees!

00:08:04.381 --> 00:08:05.882
Don't think you've won.

00:08:06.091 --> 00:08:08.009
You caught me off guard is all.

00:08:09.511 --> 00:08:11.179
You stay right there.

00:08:12.055 --> 00:08:15.809
Watch while Garou the Monster
murders your "bros."

00:08:16.393 --> 00:08:17.352
Garou?

00:08:17.769 --> 00:08:20.730
He's that human
Who calls himself a monster!

00:08:21.815 --> 00:08:25.068
Don't! Leave them alone!

00:08:25.235 --> 00:08:28.154
Justice Crash!

00:08:37.372 --> 00:08:40.083
Now... You douche bags
come at me too.

00:08:41.251 --> 00:08:44.337
Garou!

00:08:45.839 --> 00:08:48.717
I've already seen through
your fighting style.

00:08:50.552 --> 00:08:53.430
You're all done, Tank-top Master.

00:08:54.097 --> 00:08:55.056
Let's see...

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.725
All that's left
is a little clean up.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.601
Scumbag!

00:08:58.852 --> 00:09:02.063
You think you can win
against our numbers?!

00:09:07.444 --> 00:09:08.403
Damn you!

00:09:18.121 --> 00:09:19.164
Stop!

00:09:19.289 --> 00:09:20.248
Help!

00:09:25.503 --> 00:09:26.838
That's enough, Garou!

00:09:27.672 --> 00:09:29.758
You're a disgrace to the dojo!

00:09:30.008 --> 00:09:30.717
Take this!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.510
Fist of Flowing Water Crushing R—!

00:09:40.185 --> 00:09:41.978
This is awful.

00:09:42.312 --> 00:09:44.189
We were too late.

00:09:44.856 --> 00:09:45.940
Hey, Bang...

00:09:46.816 --> 00:09:50.236
Can you predict where
he might appear next?

00:09:52.405 --> 00:09:53.323
Bang?

00:09:57.452 --> 00:09:58.787
Charanko...

00:10:00.705 --> 00:10:03.750
I heard the hero hunter
took down Tank-top Master.

00:10:03.875 --> 00:10:04.918
No way!

00:10:05.085 --> 00:10:06.836
He defeated a Class S hero?

00:10:07.087 --> 00:10:08.630
They say Tank-top's disciples

00:10:08.713 --> 00:10:10.965
and Mumen Rider too
were beat all to hell.

00:10:11.216 --> 00:10:14.511
So Class S and Class C alike
are being hunted?!

00:10:14.594 --> 00:10:16.054
What're we supposed to do?

00:10:16.179 --> 00:10:18.181
How about showing some spine?

00:10:18.473 --> 00:10:21.226
Let's us three capture
this "hero hunter" ourselves!

00:10:21.393 --> 00:10:22.268
Yeah, right.

00:10:22.352 --> 00:10:24.187
He beat a Class S.

00:10:24.562 --> 00:10:26.022
Don't you get it?

00:10:26.106 --> 00:10:28.024
He's not some scary monster.

00:10:28.149 --> 00:10:29.859
He's just a human being.

00:10:30.026 --> 00:10:32.529
But I heard
he's Silverfang's former disciple.

00:10:32.862 --> 00:10:35.198
Well, I know a bit of
martial arts myself.

00:10:35.407 --> 00:10:36.991
If an opponent punches like this,

00:10:37.075 --> 00:10:38.034
you do this!

00:10:38.159 --> 00:10:39.119
And if they come this way,

00:10:39.244 --> 00:10:40.370
you block like this.

00:10:40.954 --> 00:10:42.622
And if he comes at you like this...

00:10:42.872 --> 00:10:44.040
you go like th—!

00:10:44.791 --> 00:10:45.583
He's here.

00:10:45.667 --> 00:10:49.087
HERO ASSOCIATION HOSPITAL

00:10:49.421 --> 00:10:51.214
Thanks, Saitama.

00:10:51.423 --> 00:10:53.883
Yeah. These bananas,
can I put them here?

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.218
Sure, thanks.

00:10:58.721 --> 00:10:59.722
Oh, they're for you...

00:11:00.056 --> 00:11:03.560
It was all over the Hero Association's
newsletter, you know?

00:11:05.478 --> 00:11:09.357
Said dozens of heroes were
beaten by a single monster.

00:11:09.607 --> 00:11:11.067
Lucky you survived, eh?

00:11:11.401 --> 00:11:12.527
Here, have a banana.

00:11:13.236 --> 00:11:14.696
He was a human.

00:11:14.779 --> 00:11:15.280
What?

00:11:16.156 --> 00:11:17.949
A human who called
himself a monster.

00:11:18.324 --> 00:11:19.409
But strong.

00:11:19.784 --> 00:11:21.619
A scary, strong human.

00:11:22.036 --> 00:11:24.497
Was it stronger than
that fish monster thing?

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.792
Deep Sea King was insanely tough,

00:11:28.376 --> 00:11:29.836
but somehow, this guy was different.

00:11:31.171 --> 00:11:32.130
His moves.

00:11:33.423 --> 00:11:35.341
They're sophisticated
martial arts techniques.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:39.179
It seems Silverfang raised
a true monster.

00:11:41.264 --> 00:11:43.725
This guy butting into
our conversation...

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:44.767
Any idea who he is?

00:11:44.851 --> 00:11:48.104
Shh! That's Tank-top Master,
the Class S hero.

00:11:48.229 --> 00:11:50.523
Oh, right!
He was in the newspaper.

00:11:50.773 --> 00:11:53.026
It said he took
the worst beating of all.

00:11:53.151 --> 00:11:54.861
At least say
I put up the best fight!

00:11:55.195 --> 00:11:58.448
Damn it... I never imagined
I'd lose to a punk like him.

00:11:58.656 --> 00:12:01.117
Martial arts are truly treacherous.

00:12:01.701 --> 00:12:02.494
Martial arts?

00:12:02.994 --> 00:12:03.786
Have a banana.

00:12:03.912 --> 00:12:04.454
Huh?

00:12:04.537 --> 00:12:06.372
Oh, thanks.

00:12:06.706 --> 00:12:10.502
So, think you could tell me
the details?

00:12:15.965 --> 00:12:16.925
Hey there, kid.

00:12:18.801 --> 00:12:21.095
Interesting book you've got there.

00:12:26.309 --> 00:12:29.229
This is King, a Class S hero.

00:12:29.479 --> 00:12:30.647
He's the strongest ever.

00:12:31.231 --> 00:12:33.900
This is Lightning Genji,
a Class A hero.

00:12:34.442 --> 00:12:36.986
He patrols my neighborhood
all the time.

00:12:37.195 --> 00:12:38.321
See? I got his autograph.

00:12:39.906 --> 00:12:40.990
His autograph, eh?

00:12:41.366 --> 00:12:43.034
I want his autograph, too.

00:12:43.826 --> 00:12:45.662
Think you could help me find him?

00:12:46.079 --> 00:12:47.038
Sure thing!

00:12:47.205 --> 00:12:49.249
Are you into heroes, mister?

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:55.004
HERO ALMANAC

00:12:55.255 --> 00:12:57.924
What? I don't want to.

00:12:58.007 --> 00:13:00.635
C'mon, don't be all stingy.

00:13:04.681 --> 00:13:07.850
Oh, look at that!
It lists monsters, too.

00:13:08.059 --> 00:13:09.310
Now fhat's exciting.

00:13:09.519 --> 00:13:12.021
Why're you looking at
the monster pages?

00:13:12.146 --> 00:13:13.648
They're super scary.

00:13:14.482 --> 00:13:15.608
The scarier the better.

00:13:16.276 --> 00:13:18.027
These guys are way cooler.

00:13:18.319 --> 00:13:21.197
What? You've got some
bad taste, mister.

00:13:21.322 --> 00:13:22.365
Aww man...

00:13:22.782 --> 00:13:24.867
I wish I were listed
in this book too.

00:13:25.326 --> 00:13:26.786
You want to be a hero?

00:13:27.203 --> 00:13:28.371
I do too, actually.

00:13:28.871 --> 00:13:30.582
But I'm so bad at sports and stuff.

00:13:30.915 --> 00:13:32.333
Good thing, too.

00:13:33.167 --> 00:13:34.794
You're not too nice, mister.

00:13:36.713 --> 00:13:39.299
It's patrol time.
I better get going.

00:13:40.216 --> 00:13:43.094
Accoraing to that almanac,
Golden Ball from Class A

00:13:43.219 --> 00:13:45.722
shows up at his usual pub
around this time.

00:13:46.514 --> 00:13:47.765
See you later, little turd.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.268
Be careful on your patrol, mister.

00:13:50.727 --> 00:13:51.436
I will.

00:13:51.561 --> 00:13:53.855
And don't call me "mister."

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.898
I'm not that old.

00:13:56.065 --> 00:13:57.900
Huh? You say something, mister?

00:13:59.277 --> 00:14:01.029
Go home, runt.

00:14:01.571 --> 00:14:06.159
He parried, sidestepped
or slipped all my attacks.

00:14:06.743 --> 00:14:09.746
And he read my attempts at
throws and counters.

00:14:10.038 --> 00:14:12.957
His moves reflect his opponents'
power back at double strength.

00:14:13.708 --> 00:14:16.085
Hits on pressure points
and joints are also trouble.

00:14:16.919 --> 00:14:19.631
Where he strikes, you suffer
a loss of physical function.

00:14:20.131 --> 00:14:24.260
Other monsters fight by relying
on their physical ability

00:14:24.344 --> 00:14:26.596
which they unleash
with extreme violence.

00:14:27.055 --> 00:14:28.389
Garou is different.

00:14:28.931 --> 00:14:35.521
His techniques are devised
for breaking humans.

00:14:37.857 --> 00:14:47.283
CHARANKO

00:14:47.367 --> 00:14:48.618
My name's Charanko!

00:14:49.077 --> 00:14:51.120
Here, I'll even give you a banana.

00:14:51.412 --> 00:14:52.664
Don't put it there!

00:14:54.165 --> 00:14:57.043
You should ask Master Bang
for help.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:59.045
He seems to like you, after all.

00:14:59.295 --> 00:15:03.257
Nah, what would I do
if the old dude strained himself?

00:15:03.341 --> 00:15:04.676
Now you're just being rude!

00:15:05.301 --> 00:15:08.304
Some amateur can't just go
around challenging the pros!

00:15:08.471 --> 00:15:10.223
First, you master the basic forms...

00:15:10.515 --> 00:15:12.642
No, before that,
you build your stamina,

00:15:13.101 --> 00:15:15.311
running up and down
hundreds of stairs.

00:15:15.687 --> 00:15:17.355
Maybe start by cleaning the dojo!

00:15:17.563 --> 00:15:19.691
If you don't Know anyone,
just forget it.

00:15:19.816 --> 00:15:21.150
Wait! Wait!

00:15:21.734 --> 00:15:25.238
There's this mixed-martial arts
tournament I signed up for...

00:15:26.239 --> 00:15:30.785
I'm pretty sure I have the ticket.

00:15:31.494 --> 00:15:34.622
I registered to fight,
but am gonna have to forfeit.

00:15:35.206 --> 00:15:36.999
This'll get you inside, though.

00:15:37.166 --> 00:15:38.876
So take it and go watch
the matches.

00:15:39.502 --> 00:15:41.379
You'll get to observe
many styles of fighting.

00:15:42.088 --> 00:15:43.047
Thanks.

00:15:43.548 --> 00:15:47.301
STARIIIIINNNG

00:15:47.593 --> 00:15:51.848
STARIIIIINNNG

00:15:51.931 --> 00:15:59.689
Prize money: three million.

00:15:59.772 --> 00:16:02.942
BAR ADDICTION

00:16:03.443 --> 00:16:06.446
CLASS A, RANK 26
GOLDEN BALL

00:16:06.696 --> 00:16:08.698
I'm drinking here, buddy.

00:16:09.782 --> 00:16:10.867
What the hell?!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.952
Aw man, what a waste.

00:16:15.955 --> 00:16:17.331
Okay, tough guy.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.041
There's a parking lot nearby.

00:16:19.375 --> 00:16:20.376
We'll do it there.

00:16:21.502 --> 00:16:23.337
I've seen your kind...

00:16:23.421 --> 00:16:25.882
Dweebs looking to take on
a professional hero.

00:16:27.884 --> 00:16:31.095
If it's liquid courage making you
step up, better step off now.

00:16:31.554 --> 00:16:33.389
While you can still walk.

00:16:33.556 --> 00:16:36.017
Quiet down! You drunken—

00:16:40.605 --> 00:16:41.564
You...!

00:16:42.064 --> 00:16:45.067
Not too sharp, are you,
"hero hunter"?

00:16:45.735 --> 00:16:49.071
How did Tank-top Master lose
to a jerkoff like you?

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.949
See, I ain't too bad at
hunting things down myself.

00:16:52.408 --> 00:16:53.951
So I'll lay you out quick...

00:16:54.535 --> 00:16:55.912
...then redo that drink!

00:16:58.289 --> 00:17:00.625
He read the trajectory
from my hand movement.

00:17:01.083 --> 00:17:03.085
In that case, take this!

00:17:04.086 --> 00:17:05.087
Rebound Shot.

00:17:06.756 --> 00:17:09.509
Oh, lucky nothing vital got hit.

00:17:09.926 --> 00:17:10.927
How about it?

00:17:11.093 --> 00:17:12.512
Ain't heroes incredible?

00:17:13.012 --> 00:17:14.055
I'm lucky, you say?

00:17:14.931 --> 00:17:17.892
Because you're drunk,
your coordination's off.

00:17:18.684 --> 00:17:21.979
Not finishing me with that shot
means the end for you.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:24.607
Unfortunately for you,
I got plenty more ammo.

00:17:24.941 --> 00:17:26.818
Shape Memory Golden Bullets!

00:17:26.943 --> 00:17:28.528
Multi-shot!

00:17:28.945 --> 00:17:29.862
Killer Move...

00:17:30.154 --> 00:17:32.406
Golden Breakout!

00:17:36.035 --> 00:17:37.787
He's doaging all that
with minimal movement...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.413
I take it back.

00:17:39.747 --> 00:17:40.957
This kid's on another level...

00:17:41.541 --> 00:17:42.416
Still,

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.835
I got one fast shot.

00:17:44.544 --> 00:17:45.753
Better make it count!

00:17:56.389 --> 00:17:57.181
How about it?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.100
Ain't monsters incredible?

00:17:59.892 --> 00:18:00.852
It's over.

00:18:01.644 --> 00:18:02.645
Die.

00:18:11.821 --> 00:18:13.197
You weren't in the pub,

00:18:13.322 --> 00:18:16.325
so I thought you'd perhaps
forgotten about our drink.

00:18:16.659 --> 00:18:19.161
Class A hero, Spring Mustachio.

00:18:19.579 --> 00:18:20.913
Thank you for knowing.

00:18:21.664 --> 00:18:24.166
And you, I presume,
are the much-rumored hero hunter.

00:18:24.792 --> 00:18:25.751
Ding ding ding.

00:18:26.294 --> 00:18:27.461
Your prize is:

00:18:27.545 --> 00:18:28.713
You get crushed, too.

00:18:29.255 --> 00:18:31.257
His right leg's injured.

00:18:31.674 --> 00:18:33.509
He can't use his footwork.

00:18:33.843 --> 00:18:36.679
I see it.
That's useful to know.

00:18:38.014 --> 00:18:41.142
What about you? Kinda tight
quarters for that long thing.

00:18:41.434 --> 00:18:43.603
Let's find out, shall we?

00:18:50.443 --> 00:18:51.485
Now you're mine.

00:18:53.279 --> 00:18:54.238
Tomboy!

00:18:59.869 --> 00:19:00.870
I...

00:19:01.537 --> 00:19:02.204
caught...

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.289
you!

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:08.711
Did you know?

00:19:09.045 --> 00:19:10.504
Your final moves

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.506
are listed in the hero almanac.

00:19:14.759 --> 00:19:17.053
Once I know your weapons
and patterns, it's over.

00:19:17.303 --> 00:19:19.555
You're plenty cocky now,

00:19:20.014 --> 00:19:22.767
but you can't keep this up forever.

00:19:23.768 --> 00:19:25.645
Oh, I'll be getting
much, much stronger.

00:19:25.937 --> 00:19:27.813
Take me down if you can.

00:19:28.564 --> 00:19:30.858
Until then,
I'll be as cocky as I want.

00:19:32.193 --> 00:19:35.237
Say, the Hero Association
makes lots of money, right?

00:19:35.571 --> 00:19:37.907
Don't talk nonsense, my dear.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.743
It takes a lot of capital
to maintain peace.

00:19:40.952 --> 00:19:42.536
We don't make money!

00:19:42.828 --> 00:19:44.580
Then how did you buy me this?

00:19:45.623 --> 00:19:47.583
And you always spend
so much at our place.

00:19:47.833 --> 00:19:49.627
That's for peace, of course.

00:19:49.919 --> 00:19:51.587
As a director of
the Hero Association,

00:19:51.712 --> 00:19:54.548
having fun with you
is a necessary expense.

00:19:54.632 --> 00:19:57.426
People like me who fight evil
on the front lines

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.845
need to relax and
recharge our batteries.

00:20:00.262 --> 00:20:01.305
"Relax," "relax."

00:20:01.597 --> 00:20:03.766
Do you need to "relax" every day?

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.101
Exactly right.

00:20:05.226 --> 00:20:07.186
Next time, maybe I'll bring
Amai Mask along.

00:20:07.395 --> 00:20:08.479
What? Really?

00:20:08.604 --> 00:20:10.022
I'm a huge fan!

00:20:10.314 --> 00:20:12.233
I'll introduce you for
a kiss on the cheek.

00:20:12.316 --> 00:20:14.276
Well, I don't know...

00:20:14.443 --> 00:20:15.945
You really, really mean it?

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.446
Introduce him to me, too.

00:20:18.322 --> 00:20:20.241
I'll even land you a kiss
on the cheek.

00:20:22.201 --> 00:20:24.245
Relax. It's for peace!

00:20:24.328 --> 00:20:26.497
I was riding high after
hunting down those Class A's.

00:20:26.956 --> 00:20:28.624
Now I fee! like I stepped in shit.

00:20:29.291 --> 00:20:31.377
"Fighting evil on the front line"?

00:20:31.919 --> 00:20:32.920
What a load!

00:20:33.129 --> 00:20:34.797
Oh, finally.

00:20:35.548 --> 00:20:36.507
I've been looking all day.

00:20:36.632 --> 00:20:39.176
Was he failing me?
/s he a hero too?

00:20:39.635 --> 00:20:41.303
Never seen that face before.

00:20:41.554 --> 00:20:42.763
Probably some nobody...

00:20:43.055 --> 00:20:45.891
trying to climb the ranks
by capturing me.

00:20:46.642 --> 00:20:47.643
But tables turn!

00:20:48.644 --> 00:20:49.645
Huh?

00:20:52.314 --> 00:20:53.399
What's the big idea?

00:20:54.358 --> 00:20:55.568
Who do you think you are?

00:20:55.651 --> 00:20:57.028
Are you trying to rob me?

00:20:57.695 --> 00:20:58.988
Don't bother me when I'm shopping.

00:21:03.909 --> 00:21:04.869
Excuse me!

00:21:05.161 --> 00:21:06.162
I'd like this one.

00:21:06.454 --> 00:21:07.455
3,000 yen, please.

00:21:07.997 --> 00:21:08.998
That much?

00:21:20.968 --> 00:21:25.973
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:21:26.015 --> 00:21:30.770
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:36.776
Will the future call
or Will it slio away?

00:21:36.859 --> 00:21:41.781
There's just so much
that we don't know

00:21:42.031 --> 00:21:47.328
But one day, weil make peace
within ourselves

00:21:47.578 --> 00:21:52.917
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:58.130
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:21:58.214 --> 00:22:02.218
That's what we are to each other

00:22:02.259 --> 00:22:08.599
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:22:08.766 --> 00:22:13.145
That kindness Is the true strength

00:22:13.229 --> 00:22:19.568
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:22:19.693 --> 00:22:24.949
So I promise that I'll come back

00:22:25.074 --> 00:22:30.871
I promise that lil come back to you

00:22:48.848 --> 00:22:49.598
Not bad.

00:22:50.099 --> 00:22:50.641
Master...

00:22:51.976 --> 00:22:52.810
Has it come that?

00:22:52.935 --> 00:22:53.936
No, that's not it.

00:22:54.353 --> 00:22:56.772
It's not like I'm planning to wear
a wig the rest of my—!

00:22:56.897 --> 00:22:58.315
Doctor Kuseno, this is Genos.

00:22:58.440 --> 00:22:59.608
There is an emergency.

00:23:00.442 --> 00:23:03.279
No, it has to do with Master
Saitama's condition.

00:23:03.529 --> 00:23:05.906
The reinforced artificial
hair fibers we discussed....

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:08.325
Can they be implanted
into living skin?

00:23:08.701 --> 00:23:09.618
Yes, that is right.

00:23:09.702 --> 00:23:10.995
It appears necessary, after all.

00:23:11.495 --> 00:23:13.122
Black hair fibers
are available, correct?

00:23:13.455 --> 00:23:16.208
Then when are you available
for the implant procedure?

00:23:16.792 --> 00:23:17.793
As soon as possible.

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:19.461
Wednesday next week... I see.

00:23:19.587 --> 00:23:20.921
Yes, I will be there too.

00:23:21.088 --> 00:23:21.964
I understand.

00:23:22.047 --> 00:23:24.550
Please arrange it for that date.
Thank you very much.

00:23:25.843 --> 00:23:26.594
Master Saitama!

00:23:26.677 --> 00:23:28.387
Are you available next Wednesday?

00:23:28.721 --> 00:23:30.598
You can't just transplant
reinforced hair fibers

00:23:30.681 --> 00:23:31.974
into someone's head
without asking.

00:23:32.474 --> 00:23:34.518
I'm using this to enter
a fighting tournament.

00:23:35.394 --> 00:23:36.395
As Charanko.

00:23:37.771 --> 00:23:38.606
Today?

00:23:38.689 --> 00:23:39.648
Yeah.

00:23:40.524 --> 00:23:44.320
I'm gonna go see what this
"martial arts" thing is all about.

00:23:45.112 --> 00:23:49.867
THE METAL BAT
